<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK RESERVES RISE FIM 560 MLN IN WEEK.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK RESERVES RISE FIM 560 MLN IN WEEK.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland's latest</p>
<p>balance sheet for the week to August 23 showed the following</p>
<p>positions in millions of markka compared to August 15:</p>
<p> Position			   Latest     Previous</p>
<p> Foreign reserves		 34,963	 34,403</p>
<p> Money market intervention     7,584	  6,540</p>
<p> Govt sector claims		6,460	  6,460</p>
<p> Corporate sector claims	 2,435	  2,440</p>
<p> Total assets		     61,892	 57,893</p>
<p>In the previous week, to August 15, reserves rose by 821</p>
<p>million markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
</text>
